OL,3,AFiona the hippo dies after swallowing a
OL,4,Ahat at Cincinnati Zoo
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Cincinnati Zoo in Ohio says its
OL,7,Fbeloved hippopotamus Fiona has died
OL,8,Fjust days after swallowing a knitted
OL,9,Fhat that slipped into her enclosure.
OL,11,F"It is with extreme sadness that we
OL,12,Fshare with you the devastating news
OL,13,Fthat Fiona did not make it after
OL,14,Fmultiple attempts from our amazing vets
OL,15,Fand keeper team to help her through
OL,16,Fwhat ended up being a medical
OL,17,Femergency," the zoo said on Thursday
OL,18,Fafternoon.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
