OL,3,AFiona the hippo dies after swallowing a
OL,4,Ahat at Cincinnati Zoo
OL,5,
OL,6,FFiona, who became a social media star
OL,7,Fafter her premature birth in 2017,
OL,8,Fswallowed the hat about 10 days ago and
OL,9,Frequired emergency care.
OL,11,FThe vet staff "tried everything they
OL,12,Fcould to help her" but "it was
OL,13,Fultimately too much to overcome", the
OL,14,Fzoo said.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
